BUILD BATMAN

Batman shall use an Assessment Intelligence architecture.

Assessment is broader than Quiz.

ASSESSMENT INTELLIGENCE
    │
    ├── OBJECTIVE
    │     MCQ
    │     True / False
    │     Match
    │     Fill Blank
    │
    ├── CONSTRUCTED RESPONSE
    │     Short Answer
    │     Long Answer
    │     Explain Why
    │     Numerical
    │     Derivation
    │     Proof
    │
    └── PERFORMANCE / VISUAL
